WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.040
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.750
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:19.750
Storm Clouds

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.540
I am so mad! Honestly!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.330
What did we ever do to deserve this?

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:33.080
Gilgamesh! Balarant!
I wish both armies would drop dead!

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:35.000
Just shut up and walk.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.330
Oh, get off your high horse!

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:39.710
We're out here walking
because you're such a lousy pilot!

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:42.920
Couldn't you have landed us closer to the city?

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.420
What was I supposed to do?

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.170
We were flying a broken-down rattletrap
of a shuttle through a firefight!

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:49.170
Be glad we're still alive!

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:51.500
Quit making excuses!
God, you're gutless!

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:53.130
I... You... What?

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:54.500
Knock it off, both of you!

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:56.290
Bleah!

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:59.080
I'm sick of being with you!
Just stay away from me!

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.420
You little bitch!

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:01.460
I said knock it off!

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:04.040
Who do you think was
looking out for you all the time?

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:07.000
Hmpf! As if I'd ever marry a guy like you!

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:11.880
And why don't you watch where you're standing-

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.080
You!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.000
Are you all right?

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:17.130
Shako, ol' buddy!

00:03:18.130 --> 00:03:21.130
That's him, all right!
You've got great timing, friend!

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:22.880
Where's Chirico?

00:03:23.710 --> 00:03:25.130
Chirico?

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:27.380
Who cares about that jerk?

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:30.330
Hm, still hasn't shown up, huh?

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:32.130
Thought he'd be here by now.

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:34.380
That bastard's gone nuts.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.210
He keeps saying he's Wiseman's successor.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:38.750
That's not true.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:42.710
He has some plan. That's why he said that!

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.290
Just as Meji foretold.

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:46.170
What?

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:51.630
A Child of God will walk the land once more.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.750
To decide the fate of the galaxy.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.130
What's going on here?

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.330
It's just as you said.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:22.540
Which means?

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:23.380
Yes, sir.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.580
The value's been altered, just slightly,

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:28.250
but it was enough to change our course.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:44.580
The navigation program was tampered with.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.960
The only people authorized to do it were you two.

00:04:49.290 --> 00:04:50.380
What do you mean?

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:55.380
Because of it, we're now 20 hours
behind our ETA to Quent.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.250
Are you saying we did it?

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:02.500
It appears you were using that time
to foment a mutiny.

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:07.830
Mr. Arron...

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:13.250
So, it's all out in the open now, eh?

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:14.380
Arron?

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:16.080
Gurran...

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.830
How long do you intend to obey
this overgrown child?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:27.500
For a long time, we've worked as
the tools of Wiseman.

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:30.210
Just like the late Gen. Killy,

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:33.580
when our usefulness ends,
we'll become expendable.

00:05:34.170 --> 00:05:35.540
Stop it, Arron!

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:40.080
But I was never ashamed of being a tool.

00:05:40.790 --> 00:05:43.170
Do you know why, Chirico?

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:46.670
Is it because he's God?

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.330
Exactly!

00:05:49.670 --> 00:05:53.000
No, I don't know if he's the one, true God.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.830
But he represents an existence
beyond mankind's!

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.630
At the very least, he has controlled

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:02.920
the Astragius Galaxy at his whim
for the past 3,000 years!

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.830
Would you give this boy that kind of power?

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:08.130
Can you accept that? Kill him!

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:09.630
Kill him now!

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:17.130
Take him away.

00:06:17.130 --> 00:06:17.880
Yes, sir!

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:29.500
Arron!

00:06:32.710 --> 00:06:33.880
Arron!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.460
I'll just say this.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:42.500
The one who foiled his plans and
decided upon execution was Wiseman.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.540
I am still merely a tool for him.

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:51.500
Even if you trick me,
you cannot escape Wiseman's gaze!

00:06:52.210 --> 00:06:56.040
Wherever you are, whatever you're doing,
he is watching you.

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:59.920
If you have no traitorous thoughts,
then swear your loyalty to me.

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:02.540
I swear! I swear my loyalty!

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.250
Very well. Set course for Quent!

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:11.250
Chirico, are you serious?

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:14.630
No, I still don't believe it.

00:07:14.630 --> 00:07:16.540
I'll know for sure, soon...

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.380
When we stand before Wiseman.

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:29.920
It's unexpected, their making for Quent.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:32.040
Wiseman's stronghold...

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.210
But it's certain.

00:07:34.210 --> 00:07:39.790
Our fleets vanished from the space
around Quent in an instant!

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:44.790
The battle this time will be to blow Quent apart.

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:47.380
Because the secret of Wiseman
has been uncovered now.

00:07:47.380 --> 00:07:53.250
That's why we need to throw
the largest fleet in history at him.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:03.580
I'll go down first, then send
the transport back at once.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.500
Land as soon as you're able.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:06.080
Yes, sir!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.540
I'm sorry about Mr. Arron, sir.

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:15.380
Chirico's only armed with one AT.

00:08:15.380 --> 00:08:17.540
With just that, we should be able to-

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.000
What are you suggesting?

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.670
Uh, nothing.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:24.000
I just felt sorry for you.

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:25.580
Don't ever mention it again!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:28.540
Don't think about anything
except helping Chirico!

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:29.790
Forgive me!

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:36.790
If Wiseman really is on this planet...

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:42.000
Then, I... I...

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.710
Horrible...

00:08:55.580 --> 00:09:00.130
How do we know Chirico's coming here?

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.460
Shako said he was.

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.920
Besides, they're keeping watch for anything.

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:10.710
I still can't believe it.

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:14.040
He'd never become Wiseman's successor.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:17.040
That's why I know there's some reason.

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:20.540
But he abandoned you all and ran.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:24.290
That doesn't sound like the Chirico I know.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.580
I know...

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:27.580
But still...!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.790
I like him, too.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.500
That's why I want to be sure.

00:09:39.960 --> 00:09:41.500
All finished.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:45.500
It's just an old, junked Berserga,
but it's a good machine.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:48.040
And I hear you're pretty good.

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.330
I don't need it.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.880
Like hell you don't!

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:52.540
He's not going to be alone.

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:54.880
He'll probably have tons of helpers with him.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:09:58.420
We want you to get him back to normal.

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:02.420
If you're not careful, we'll never stop
that joint fleet from coming.

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:03.250
Exactly!

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:04.170
Hold it...

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:05.880
He's coming!

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.330
He's headed for the space port.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.170
Please, hide yourselves.

00:11:01.580 --> 00:11:03.250
We meet again.

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:07.040
How did you know I was coming?

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:11.210
Do you remember Meji?

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:13.130
He predicted it before he died.

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.790
I don't know why you're here, but I'll help.

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:21.000
I'm being chased.

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:24.460
The Gilgamesh and Balarant fleets
will be here soon.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:25.790
I see.

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:30.380
In the last battle, they were destroyed
by that light from Quent.

00:11:30.380 --> 00:11:33.790
I think the control and
power systems for it are here.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.920
I want to check it out.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.920
We'll need it again this time.

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:41.750
I see. I'll take point.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:20.630
Ever since you came here, I've seen
there are still secrets hidden in this world.

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:24.540
That huge underground manufacturing plant.

00:12:25.750 --> 00:12:29.540
Those instant transporters
that saved you over and over.

00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:32.670
And that powerful light, too.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:37.250
I thought we Quentians abandoned
civilization 3,000 years ago.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:39.670
But, then, what is all that?

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:46.080
Is it just that surviving artifacts from our past
were accidently reactivated?

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:49.170
Were they guarding us?

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:53.080
Or were they used to save
you specifically from danger?

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:57.210
And if that's the case, who was using them?

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.880
I'm in a hurry, Shako.

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:03.960
Right.

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.790
We went in there before.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:09.500
If we go deeper inside, we'll see.

00:13:20.750 --> 00:13:21.880
What's the big idea?

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:23.580
You're too close to Fyana!

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:25.790
You're always going on and on about Chirico!

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:31.000
I'll go ahead!

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:34.250
Jeez, she's acting like a ball and chain already!

00:13:59.670 --> 00:14:00.630
What the?

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.130
It's a transporter.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.500
You're always so surprised by things! Come on!

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:14.790
Whoa, wait, I don't think we should-

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.130
What're you scared of?

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:16.960
Wait a minute!

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:17.790
Let's go!

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.330
Is this... the control room?

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:20.080
That must be the mother computer.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.750
What's this?

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:38.960
Ancient Quentian writing.

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:43.380
The language my ancestors
abandoned 3,000 years ago.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.290
Can you read it?

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:49.830
"Operations... normal..."

00:15:50.330 --> 00:15:54.540
So, even if the enemy shows, they'll be repulsed.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:57.210
That's all I needed.

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:01.290
So, now you can meet Wiseman at your leisure?

00:16:03.920 --> 00:16:04.920
I see...

00:16:04.920 --> 00:16:07.670
You ran into Gotho and the others.

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:10.210
Is it true?

00:16:10.630 --> 00:16:12.880
Is a Child of God on this world?

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:21.250
The god you thought you'd
driven from your world

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:24.170
has been under your feet for 3,000 years,
and you never realized it.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.540
Wiseman's somewhere underground.

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:33.830
That plant in the cave near your village
is the entrance.

00:16:33.830 --> 00:16:38.040
You're not serious about
becoming his successor, are you?

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.710
Yes, I am.

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:49.210
You're lying!

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:54.750
If I was, then I wouldn't have
abandoned Fyana and the others.

00:16:55.130 --> 00:16:57.790
But it doesn't matter what you think.

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.540
What's the point in following
in Wiseman's footsteps?

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:03.580
Don't you understand?

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:08.040
This galaxy needs to be controlled!

00:17:12.750 --> 00:17:15.500
Because of war, many people die.

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:18.670
But it gives birth to new civilizations as well!

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:21.960
War is the creator of history!

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:24.290
It is the Prime Force of progress!

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:27.880
War is necessary for Mankind!

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:33.330
And the one to control it
must be the one, true God!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.250
Stop it, Chirico!

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:38.040
I may have been born an Overman,

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:42.130
but it was in combat
that I achieved my full potential.

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:45.960
And, as Wiseman's successor,
no one will stand against me!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:50.460
The people of Quent will never allow this!

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:53.460
Try and shoot me.

00:17:56.040 --> 00:17:57.960
Wiseman protects me.

00:17:58.250 --> 00:18:00.500
He'll just move me to somewhere else!

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:01.540
Chirico!

00:18:01.920 --> 00:18:03.790
I am protected by God himself!

00:18:18.960 --> 00:18:19.830
Chirico!

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:21.290
Say it isn't true.

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:24.330
Say it isn't true!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:27.040
It is.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.790
I'll stop you with my bare hands!

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:55.920
Chirico...!

00:19:00.210 --> 00:19:01.130
Chirico!

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:05.580
Shako!

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:09.710
You son of a...! I'll kill you!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:10.710
No!

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:17.710
Chirico!

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:19.380
Chirico, come back!

00:19:21.380 --> 00:19:22.170
Chirico!

00:19:25.630 --> 00:19:26.630
Stay away!

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:31.790
Chirico!

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.290
Come on!

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:48.580
Where's Fyana?

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:54.960
Okay, move it!

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:20.880
God damn him!

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:23.080
Next time, Chirico's gonna be sorry!

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:25.830
There's nothing left for us on this world.
Let's get out of here.

00:20:26.500 --> 00:20:27.500
It's Chirico!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:28.290
What?

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:31.380
There! Over there! See him?

00:20:32.080 --> 00:20:34.830
Damn, he's fast on his feet!

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:36.670
Fyana!

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:39.960
I'm going after him!

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:41.040
Don't do it!

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:44.170
The Gilgamesh and Balarant fleets
will be here soon!

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:48.170
I'm going to bring Chirico back, no matter what!

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:51.420
Forget it, Fyana! He's not the guy we knew!

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:53.920
Goodbye.

00:20:55.500 --> 00:20:56.080
Fya-!

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:07.080
Chirico...

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:14.170
Four hundred...
No, I estimate five hundred ships!

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:16.080
Approaching rapidly.

00:21:16.080 --> 00:21:17.880
They're finally here.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:23.040
Chirico here.
I'm en route to the Quentian village.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.290
Yes, sir.

00:21:24.290 --> 00:21:27.420
You have my location.
Send down as many escort ATs as possible.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:28.790
You'll need a fleet!

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:31.880
The Gilgamesh-Balarant
combined fleet has appeared.

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:34.630
Wiseman's defense system has been destroyed.

00:21:35.380 --> 00:21:37.630
You'll have to fight them without any support.

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:41.420
Don't panic! Just follow my orders!

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.630
Take us to DefCon 2!

00:22:01.580 --> 00:22:02.670
Chirico...

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:11.210
They're all AT transports!
A hell of a lot of them!

00:22:11.210 --> 00:22:12.920
They don't look like they're headed this way.

00:22:13.330 --> 00:22:14.920
Get those escorts down to Chirico!

00:22:14.920 --> 00:22:15.790
Yes, sir!

00:22:23.670 --> 00:22:24.580
Chirico!

00:22:24.790 --> 00:22:25.790
Chirico!

00:22:26.330 --> 00:22:28.000
Answer me, Chirico!

00:22:28.000 --> 00:22:29.500
Stay away, Fyana.

00:22:29.830 --> 00:22:30.500
Chirico!

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:32.580
I never want to see you again.

00:22:32.580 --> 00:22:34.330
I've abandoned everything now!

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:35.880
It's not true! It's not true!

00:22:35.880 --> 00:22:38.130
Stay away! Get off this planet!

00:22:39.210 --> 00:22:41.540
My final battle was beginning.

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:44.420
Would I be blown to atoms?

00:22:44.420 --> 00:22:46.580
Or would I inherit the Throne of God?

00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:55.170
Next Episode

00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:58.000
A god near death calls out.

00:22:58.330 --> 00:23:00.290
And even if he must make
the entire galaxy his enemy,

00:23:00.290 --> 00:23:02.080
